  "system": {
    "identifier": "kashu-demonic-instrument-always-in-danger",
    "description": "<p>With a feeling of superiority, you raise your Shinobi Instrument and reveal that the battlefield was never safe for your foes. Your Bell Wires no longer are dispelled when they detonate. Instead, for the duration, when they are detonated, you immediately place another that becomes primed at the beginning of your next turn, at which point it becomes active and can be triggered as per usual.</p>\n<p>Also, when your Bell Wires trigger, you can choose to spend this jutsu’s concentration cost in place of spending your reaction to cast a Kashu clan Hijutsu. If you do, you can only cast Kashu clan Hijutsu of C-Rank or lower.</p>",
